    14	// ProcessTaskPorts: an `mmaps<T, N>` expands to N per-channel `mmap` ports
    15	// (`name[i]`); `istreams`/`ostreams` and `hmap` stay single but carry
    16	// `chan_count` (and `hmap` a `chan_size`); everything else is one port.
    17	std::vector<Port> BuildPorts(const clang::ASTContext& ctx,
