    16	// (rather than a local FIFO) are recorded as depth-less external FIFOs with a
    17	// single endpoint, so the kernel-boundary streams appear in the task graph.
    18	// Reports stream wiring errors (double produce/consume, half-connected) and
    19	// prunes unused streams via `ctx` diagnostics. A no-op for a leaf task.
